        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We accept that we are rather a diverse and motley crew. Ranging from the young and vibrant, to the more middle aged and NOT so sedate (that would be Trevor!)</p><p>From true Lancastrians to mad Scots, to multi-linguists. Dive masters to computer boffins, and the ex-head boy. The dance teacher, the intrepid travellers, the textile designer and the ex-cricketer (now current golfer of course).</p>"
          }
        }
      },
