            "caption": "",
            "heading": "We’re sure you get the picture…",
            "text": "<p>The mums, the dads, the animal lovers, the nature lovers. The two legged, the four legged, the hairy, the not so hairy… and the positively furry! (And not forgetting the ones with the questionable taste in jewellery!)</p><p>Enough now! As we said, a rather varied bunch with a collective love of candles, fragrances and hot wax!</p>",
